  "about": "What research/gf-scenic/tools/art-kaykit.mjs fetches and curates into this library (bodies.json, props.json, LICENSES.json). Edit this file, not the generated ones. Every file comes from Kay Lousberg's official GitHub repositories (account KayKit-Game-Assets) at a pinned commit; sources.lock.json pins each file's sha256.",
  "scale": 0.75,
  "scaleWhy": "KayKit units x 0.75 = metres, for bodies and props alike, so they keep their sizes relative to each other: the Knight (with helmet) 1.74 m, a dungeon wall 3 m high on a 3 m grid.",
  "grid": 3,
  "gridWhy": "The dungeon kit is modular on a 4-unit grid (3 m here). Props with \"origin\": \"grid\" keep KayKit's own origin (a wall centred on its grid line with its base at 0, a floor tile with its top at 0, a banner or wall torch at the wall's face), only scaled; every other prop is baked with its base at y = 0, centred on x/z.",
